    "title": "Air National Guard Civilian Safety Professional of the Year 2026 Named - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WKTV ,\n9 hours ago ROME, N.Y. -- A Barneveld resident has been recognized as the Air National Guard's Civilian Safety Professional of the Year for 2026. Colt Brumm has worked as a civilian employee at the Eastern Air Defense Sector since 2015 and serves as the safety and occupational health manager with the 224th Air Defense Group. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
